# iter-57 Phase 7 — Tree-Sitter Kotlin/Native cinterop descriptor.
#
# STATUS: SCAFFOLDED-BUT-NOT-YET-WIRED (commented out below).
#
# This .def file documents the linking strategy chosen by Phase 0
# research (`docs/features/syntax-highlighting/research-report.md`
# §2.2 + §2.3 + §2.4). Phase 7 cannot wire it up yet because:
#
#   (A) The iOS K/N baseline is BLOCKED by a pre-existing defect in
#       the sibling submodule `:Document-KMP:compileKotlinIosArm64`
#       (`/Users/milosvasic/Projects/Document-KMP/src/iosMain/kotlin/
#       digital/vasic/document/Document.ios.kt:9:50` —
#       `ExperimentalForeignApi` opt-in missing + unresolved
#       `objectForKey` references). Per CONST-038 the sibling
#       submodule cannot be fixed from this repo. See KNOWN_DEFECTS
#       entry `#phase-7-blocked-on-ios-baseline`.
#
#   (B) The static libraries this `.def` references
#       (`libtree-sitter.a`, `libtree-sitter-markdown.a`) for the
#       `ios_arm64`, `ios_simulator_arm64`, and `macos_x64`
#       slices are NOT vendored in the repo yet — Phase 0 §2.6
#       flagged this as an OPEN operator spike (per-grammar build
#       pipeline on iOS, expected output documented).
#
# When BOTH (A) and (B) are resolved:
#   1. Uncomment the directives below.
#   2. Drop the static libs into
#      `shared/src/iosMain/nativeLibs/{ios_arm64,
#       ios_simulator_arm64, macos_x64}/`.
#   3. Wire this `.def` into `shared/build.gradle.kts` via
#      `kotlin { iosArm64 { compilations.getByName("main") {
#         cinterops.create("tree_sitter") {
#            defFile(project.file(
#                "src/iosMain/cinterop/tree-sitter.def"))
#         } } } }`
#      (and equivalent blocks for `iosSimulatorArm64` /
#      `iosX64`).
#   4. Replace the `NotImplementedError` stub in
#      `TokenizerEngine.ios.kt` with a real cinterop-backed
#      implementation calling `ts_parser_new` /
#      `ts_parser_set_language` / `ts_parser_parse_string` /
#      `ts_tree_root_node` etc.
#
# References:
#   - Phase 0 research §2: docs/features/syntax-highlighting/
#     research-report.md
#   - Tree-Sitter public C header:
#     https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/blob/master/lib/include/tree_sitter/api.h
#   - K/N cinterop docs:
#     https://kotlinlang.org/docs/native-c-interop.html
#   - Apple App Review Guidelines §2.5.2 (static linking OK):
#     https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/#software-requirements
#
# language = C
# headers = tree_sitter/api.h
# linkerOpts.ios_arm64 = -L${TREE_SITTER_PREFIX}/lib -ltree-sitter -ltree-sitter-markdown -lstdc++
# linkerOpts.ios_simulator_arm64 = -L${TREE_SITTER_PREFIX}/lib -ltree-sitter -ltree-sitter-markdown -lstdc++
# linkerOpts.macos_arm64 = -L${TREE_SITTER_PREFIX}/lib -ltree-sitter -ltree-sitter-markdown -lstdc++
# staticLibraries = libtree-sitter.a libtree-sitter-markdown.a
# libraryPaths.ios_arm64 = src/iosMain/nativeLibs/ios_arm64
# libraryPaths.ios_simulator_arm64 = src/iosMain/nativeLibs/ios_simulator_arm64
# libraryPaths.macos_arm64 = src/iosMain/nativeLibs/macos_arm64
# compilerOpts = -I${TREE_SITTER_PREFIX}/include
